<section class="single-herbs-guide__section" aria-labelledby="topic-thirty-foundations"><h4 id="topic-thirty-foundations"><?php echo s($orificetext('Aromatic substances that open the orifices: general introduction', 'Sustancias aromáticas que abren los orificios: introducción general')); ?></h4><p class="single-herbs-guide__section-lead"><?php echo s($orificetext('Two keys open two different locks. Shi Chang Pu is the warm key for Damp-Phlegm fog; Niu Huang is the cold key for Heat-toxin closure. Before choosing either, confirm Excess Locked-up syndrome—not Deficiency collapse.', 'Dos llaves abren cerraduras distintas. Shi Chang Pu es la llave tibia para niebla de Flema-Humedad; Niu Huang, la llave fría para cierre por Calor-tóxico. Antes, confirma síndrome cerrado de Exceso, no colapso deficiente.')); ?></p><div class="single-herbs-guide__decision"><div><strong><?php echo s($orificetext('Warm fog key', 'Llave tibia de niebla')); ?></strong><span>Shi Chang Pu</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($orificetext('Cold fire key', 'Llave fría de fuego')); ?></strong><span>Niu Huang</span></div><div><strong><?php echo s($orificetext('Do not open', 'No abrir')); ?></strong><span><?php echo s($orificetext('Collapse', 'Colapso')); ?></span></div></div><aside class="single-herbs-guide__memory-path"><p class="single-herbs-guide__memory-line"><?php echo s($orificetext('The emergency hallway has two locked doors.', 'El pasillo de emergencia tiene dos puertas cerradas.')); ?></p><p><?php echo s($orificetext('Behind the warm, fogged door, Shi Chang Pu dries the Damp-Phlegm from the keyhole and restores clarity. Behind the burning red door, Niu Huang cools Heat-toxin and stops Wind from shaking the frame. A limp, cold, sweating patient is not behind either locked door—the building is collapsing, so do not use these keys.', 'Tras la puerta tibia y empañada, Shi Chang Pu seca Flema-Humedad y restaura claridad. Tras la puerta roja ardiente, Niu Huang enfría Calor-tóxico y detiene Viento. Un paciente flácido, frío y sudoroso no está tras esas puertas: el edificio colapsa; no uses estas llaves.')); ?></p></aside><p class="single-herbs-guide__safety"><strong><?php echo s($orificetext('Emergency boundary:', 'Límite de emergencia:')); ?></strong> <?php echo s($orificetext('Loss of consciousness, new seizure, stroke signs, high fever with altered mental status or breathing difficulty requires emergency services. This material is for Board recognition, not home treatment.', 'Pérdida de conciencia, convulsión nueva, signos de ictus, fiebre alta con alteración mental o dificultad respiratoria requiere emergencias. Esto es reconocimiento Board, no tratamiento doméstico.')); ?></p><ol class="single-herbs-guide__category-herbs"><?php foreach ($orificeherbs as $h): ?><li class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb single-herbs-guide__category-herb--core"><div class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-head"><strong><?php echo s($h['name']); ?></strong><em><?php echo s($h['latin']); ?></em><span class="single-herbs-guide__category-herb-badge"><?php echo s($orificetext('Current category list', 'Lista vigente de la categoría')); ?></span></div><p><?php echo s($h['identity']); ?></p></li><?php endforeach; ?></ol></section>

